    "text": "The area of the bounded region enclosed by the curve <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and the <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>-axis is"
